        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">This dataset includes the reaction of lithium fluoride, phosphorous pentachloride and hydrogen fluoride in an autoclave to lithium hexafluorophosphate and hydrogen chloride. Conversion factor for lithium is 86.7%. The reaction temperatur is -78°C. Assumption: Cooling happens with a heat pump (coefficient of performance = 1.5). Neutralisation of hydrogen flouride and hydrogen chloride with potassium hydroxide. Phosphorous trifluoride is proxy for phosphorous pentafluoride for emission to air.\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset includes the reaction of lithium fluoride, phosphorous pentachloride and hydrogen fluoride in an autoclave to lithium hexafluorophosphate and hydrogen chloride. Conversion factor for lithium is 86.7%. The reaction temperatur is -78°C. Assumption: Cooling happens with a heat pump (coefficient of performance = 1.5). Neutralisation of hydrogen flouride and hydrogen chloride with potassium hydroxide. Phosphorous trifluoride is proxy for phosphorous pentafluoride for emission to air. Transports according to ecoinvent standards.For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
    </processInformation>
